WEBVTT

00:06.840 --> 00:08.507
Your Highness drinks so readily

00:08.840 --> 00:10.000
Aren't you afraid

00:10.080 --> 00:11.400
I put poison in this soup?

00:11.560 --> 00:12.840
If you wanted to poison me

00:12.920 --> 00:14.120
There are ten thousand ways

00:14.200 --> 00:16.280
Why bother bringing it to me yourself?

00:16.360 --> 00:18.360
The hangover soup has herbs added

00:18.920 --> 00:21.253
Tomorrow you won't have a hangover headache

00:44.600 --> 00:46.000
Thank you, sister

00:51.080 --> 00:52.480
The smell of alcohol is so strong

00:52.560 --> 00:53.960
It's overwhelming

00:55.720 --> 00:57.720
The food at other people's residences

00:57.840 --> 00:59.480
Is always better than home

01:00.840 --> 01:02.320
I'll learn from it later

01:02.400 --> 01:03.800
To add some freshness

01:04.040 --> 01:05.000
So no one will

01:05.080 --> 01:06.747
Worry that I'm starving you

01:07.040 --> 01:08.440
You manage the household

01:08.560 --> 01:10.880
Who would dare criticize you?

01:11.360 --> 01:12.280
Even if they don't say it

01:12.440 --> 01:13.920
They still worry in their hearts

01:14.080 --> 01:14.880
Let's go

01:14.960 --> 01:16.360
Rest early today

01:16.480 --> 01:18.200
You stay up all night reading documents

01:18.280 --> 01:20.613
That light keeps me from sleeping well

01:24.880 --> 01:26.360
Wan'er respectfully sees off Your Highness

01:26.440 --> 01:27.680
Princess Consort
